# linkedin's kill switches (core/modules/linkedin/README.md "API"): an account's pause and the
# workspace's "Stop everything" stop every LinkedIn action through them, reads included, from the
# next reservation. Two variables besides the usual ones go in http-client.private.env.json:
# `accountId`, an id GET …/linkedin/accounts answers, and `teammateAccountId`, a teammate's account
# an Owner's GET …/linkedin/accounts lists (gamma-p6-070: a Member's lists their own only). Pause and unpause are @Idempotent(): the
# Idempotency-Key is an example UUID; another one presses again, the same one answers the first
# answer again for a day. PUT takes no key: it sets a state. A write sends the cookie, so it sends
# Origin: {{appOrigin}} too.

### POST /v1/workspaces/{workspaceId}/linkedin/accounts/{id}/pause: pauses the account, its owner or an Owner (linkedin.manage); a paused one stays as it is; 200 with the account, paused and pausedBy; 403 not_account_owner for a Member's teammate's account
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/workspaces/{{workspaceId}}/linkedin/accounts/{{accountId}}/pause
Accept: application/json
Cookie: {{sessionCookie}}
Origin: {{appOrigin}}
Idempotency-Key: 00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000001040

### POST /v1/workspaces/{workspaceId}/linkedin/accounts/{id}/unpause: resumes the account: a tester's pause, its owner or an Owner; a removed member's (pausedBy member_removed), its owner only; 200 with the account; 403 not_account_owner; 409 stopped_by_operator when the operator paused it
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/workspaces/{{workspaceId}}/linkedin/accounts/{{accountId}}/unpause
Accept: application/json
Cookie: {{sessionCookie}}
Origin: {{appOrigin}}
Idempotency-Key: 00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000001041

### POST /v1/workspaces/{workspaceId}/linkedin/accounts/{id}/pause, as an Owner, of a teammate's account (gamma-p6-070): 200 with the account, paused by the tester, canUnpause true; a Member's session gets 403 not_account_owner
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/workspaces/{{workspaceId}}/linkedin/accounts/{{teammateAccountId}}/pause
Accept: application/json
Cookie: {{sessionCookie}}
Origin: {{appOrigin}}
Idempotency-Key: 00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000006070

### GET /v1/workspaces/{workspaceId}/linkedin/controls: the platform's switches (sendingOpen, stopped, invitesPaused) and the workspace's stop with its stopSource
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/workspaces/{{workspaceId}}/linkedin/controls
Accept: application/json
Cookie: {{sessionCookie}}

### PUT /v1/workspaces/{workspaceId}/linkedin/controls: the workspace's "Stop everything" on or off, an Owner's (linkedin.manage); 200 with the controls; 403 forbidden for a Member; 409 stopped_by_operator to lift the operator's stop
PUT {{baseUrl}}/v1/workspaces/{{workspaceId}}/linkedin/controls
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Cookie: {{sessionCookie}}
Origin: {{appOrigin}}

{ "stopped": true }
